状态基本上就是路由器在做出选择之前所看到的一切。
The state is basically whatever the router gets to look at before making its choice.

28
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:59,040
它可能是你刚刚输入的文本提示词、任务的通用类型，甚至是机器人正对着的物理视觉场景。
It could be the text prompt you just typed in, the general type of task,
or even the physical visual scene sitting right in front of a robot.

29
00:01:59,822 --> 00:02:08,699
所以路由器的全部工作就是观察那个状态，立即从工具箱中提取出最佳候选模型，
并找出这种协调思路是否真的可行。
So the router's entire job is to look at that state and immediately pull the best
candidate from the toolbox and to figure out if this orchestration idea actually works.

30
00:02:08,820 --> 00:02:11,460
研究人员不仅仅测试了几个聊天机器人。
The researchers didn't just test a couple of chatbots.

